        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141060/extras/b8586a9a52eaf22abe72aaf97ce8b2a6.avif?t=1787860843\" width=608 height=225 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WEEPING ANGELS CARVED INTO STONE CRY OUT FOR THEIR MAKERS, NOT KNOWING IT IS TOO LATE.</strong><br><strong>Count yourself lucky, Son of Drop.</strong> <br>Count yourself lucky that the breath of <i>Aphantasia</i> has yet to discover your presence.<br><br>Play as the <strong>Son of Drop</strong>, Roudert, on a questionable quest to rescue your good acquaintance, <strong>The Mouse</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet friends and foes alike as you travel the island of <strong>Mollagit</strong>, featuring <strong>sub-par world-building</strong> and <strong>characters with abhorrent personalities</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore alongside <strong>Largo</strong>, the fastest purple-colored creature in Mollagit!<br>Fight beside <strong>Mustaeyed</strong>, a loyal Royal Guard and long-time friend of Roudert!<br>Also some <strong>big stinking loser</strong> called <strong>Caleidoface</strong> is there too</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your brave and crude journey, the <strong>choices you make as Roudert</strong> will shape the story.<br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What will become of these four slightly-below-average-but-on-occasion-just-average adventurers?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choice is yours, <strong>Son of Drop</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4141060/extras/b8586a9a52eaf22abe72aaf97ce8b2a6.avif?t=1787860843\" width=608 height=225 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WEEPING ANGELS CARVED INTO STONE CRY OUT FOR THEIR MAKERS, NOT KNOWING IT IS TOO LATE.</strong><br><strong>Count yourself lucky, Son of Drop.</strong> <br>Count yourself lucky that the breath of <i>Aphantasia</i> has yet to discover your presence.<br><br>Play as the <strong>Son of Drop</strong>, Roudert, on a questionable quest to rescue your good acquaintance, <strong>The Mouse</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet friends and foes alike as you travel the island of <strong>Mollagit</strong>, featuring <strong>sub-par world-building</strong> and <strong>characters with abhorrent personalities</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore alongside <strong>Largo</strong>, the fastest purple-colored creature in Mollagit!<br>Fight beside <strong>Mustaeyed</strong>, a loyal Royal Guard and long-time friend of Roudert!<br>Also some <strong>big stinking loser</strong> called <strong>Caleidoface</strong> is there too</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your brave and crude journey, the <strong>choices you make as Roudert</strong> will shape the story.<br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What will become of these four slightly-below-average-but-on-occasion-just-average adventurers?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choice is yours, <strong>Son of Drop</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
